2. **Q2 Budget PPT Materials**: This email outlines the key components of the corporation's second-quarter budget. It details revenue projections across various groups (CCG, DCAI, NEX, AXG), operating expenses (R&D, SG&A, CapEx), and investment highlights focusing on R&D, manufacturing expansion, and strategic partnerships. It also covers cost optimization initiatives, profitability targets, and risk mitigation strategies related to supply chain and market competition."
